{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Dustoria",
    "steam_appid": 3742110,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742110/extras/25c8960b8ba88e8f108c0eb2f7451823.avif?t=1754406347\" width=616 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Dustoria</strong>, you begin with a few structures and a wide, open desert.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No enemies. No timers. Just soft winds, golden light, and the slow joy of building something from nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You choose how your settlement takes shape, there's no rush.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742110/extras/848592920c381dd1cb622515a057b06a.avif?t=1754406347\" width=616 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each building gives points based on where and how you place it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your water collector near moisture, solar panels in open areas, farms close to homes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s part strategy, part creativity, like a puzzle you build at your own rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742110/extras/cb706b938bd20ddeab72fe3bd5467095.avif?t=1754406347\" width=616 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you level up, you gain a new piece of land. These extra tiles are procedurally generated and can be placed wherever you choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to expand near your water collectors? Or leave space for future buildings? It's up to you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742110/extras/25c8960b8ba88e8f108c0eb2f7451823.avif?t=1754406347\" width=616 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Dustoria</strong>, you begin with a few structures and a wide, open desert.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No enemies. No timers. Just soft winds, golden light, and the slow joy of building something from nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You choose how your settlement takes shape, there's no rush.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742110/extras/848592920c381dd1cb622515a057b06a.avif?t=1754406347\" width=616 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each building gives points based on where and how you place it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your water collector near moisture, solar panels in open areas, farms close to homes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s part strategy, part creativity, like a puzzle you build at your own rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742110/extras/cb706b938bd20ddeab72fe3bd5467095.avif?t=1754406347\" width=616 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you level up, you gain a new piece of land. These extra tiles are procedurally generated and can be placed wherever you choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to expand near your water collectors? Or leave space for future buildings? It's up to you.</p>",
    "short_description": "Shape a quiet settlement in a forgotten desert. Keep your people comfortable, manage scarce resources, and slowly expand your city.",
